# Flutter 3.24.4 API pin

This repo builds and ships with **Flutter 3.24.4** (`flutter-sdk/`, `make build-app`). Do **not** apply Material / widget APIs from newer Flutter docs or training data.

## Rules

- Target API surface = **3.24.4** only until P5.1 upgrades the SDK/engine.
- Prefer matching existing widgets in `app/hmi/lib/` over “current best practice” from latest Flutter.
- After Dart UI changes, verify with the pinned SDK (`make build-app` or `flutter-sdk/bin/flutter analyze` in `app/hmi/`). Host/`fvm`/IDE Flutter newer than 3.24.4 is not authoritative.

## Known trap: `DropdownButtonFormField`

```dart
// ❌ BAD — newer Flutter; fails on 3.24.4 AOT build
DropdownButtonFormField<T>(initialValue: selected, ...)

// ✅ GOOD — Flutter 3.24.4
DropdownButtonFormField<T>(value: selected, ...)
```

Do not “fix deprecations” by renaming `value` → `initialValue` (or similar renames) unless the pinned 3.24.4 SDK accepts them.
